<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Merge</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command to generate a single coherent dataset from the selected scan data entities. The resulting data then can be post-processed in KUBE and exported to a variety of formats.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b><font id="font1" style="x-on-hover:fontchange(color=#ff0000, Bold=on); position:relative;">Note</font><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript1.2">
<!--
kadovInitEffects('font1');
//-->
</script></b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: Although it is not widely used this command can also be applied to meshes (already merged from scan data or imported from other file formats).</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Related topic</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: &#160;</span><a href="Polygon_Reduction.htm">Polygon Reduction</a></p>
